# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IWILLBUILD Portal — .dockerignore
#
# The publish pipeline uses a "fast path": it detects dist/server.bundle.mjs
# and deploys the pre-built artifacts directly WITHOUT running npm ci or a
# fresh build in the container. So dist/ MUST be included in the upload.
#
# Upload budget breakdown (target < 20 MB):
#   dist/          ~13 MB  ← required (pre-built artifacts)
#   src/           ~6.3 MB ← required (source for SSR / reference)
#   package*.json  ~0.7 MB ← required (npm ci fallback)
#   everything else excluded
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

# Git history — 44 MB, never needed in the build container
.git
.gitignore
.gitattributes

# Dependencies — 777 MB, installed fresh if needed
node_modules

# Sub-package lock files (root package-lock.json is kept for npm ci)
dev-tools/package-lock.json
dev-tools/pnpm-lock.yaml
source-mapper/package-lock.json
content-plugin/package-lock.json
content-lib/package-lock.json

# Logs and OS junk
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
.npm/_logs
*.log
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Test files
**/__tests__/**
**/test/**
**/tests/**
**/*.test.ts
**/*.test.tsx
**/*.spec.ts
**/*.spec.tsx

# Internal docs
IWILLBUILD_SYSTEM_MAP.md
README.md
